# ==============================================================
# DSH – single root .gitignore
# All patterns use **/ prefix so they apply recursively to the
# root and every sub-module without needing per-module files.
# ==============================================================

# ----- Maven generated output -----
**/target/

# ----- IntelliJ IDEA -----
**/.idea/
**/*.iml
**/*.iws
**/*.ipr

# ----- Eclipse -----
**/.project
**/.classpath
**/.settings/

# ----- MCP / AI tooling -----
**/.mcp.json
**/.ai/

# ----- Runtime logs -----
**/error-logs.txt

# ----- Misc -----
**/*.md.html
